d 'BCRPDATA': module to download statistical series from the Central Reserve Bank of Peru
d
d     bcrpdata queries the BCRPData API of the Central Reserve Bank
d of Peru (   
d https://estadisticas.bcrp.gob.pe/estadisticas/series/) and leaves
d in memory a	 dataset with a fecha (date) variable and one
d variable per series, named after the	  series code and labeled
d with the series description. The dataset is tsset. 
d
d KW: data management
d KW: Peru
d KW: central bank
d KW: BCRP
d KW: time series
d KW: API
d KW: macroeconomic data
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261126
d
d Author: Andres Talavera Cuya,   Direccion Nacional de Censos y Encuestas -- INEI Peru
d Support: email atalaveracuya@@gmail.com
d
f bcrpdata.ado
f bcrpdata.sthlp
f bcrpdata_es.sthlp
